WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:08.850
In Manage hosting, open WordPress, and click Install WordPress.

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.765
Choose the domain, and enter your site title and admin email.

3
00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:14.222
Then start the install.

4
00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:28.450
It only takes a moment.

5
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.491
When it's ready, click Log in to WordPress admin.

6
00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:33.001
No password needed.

7
00:00:33.051 --> 00:00:50.531
To try out changes safely, open the site menu, and choose Create staging copy.
